      "versionNonce": 1408476915,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787837971542,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Selling the consistency of how you represent state in a service.\nThis is a thing that *should* be done consistently across your application. \nSignal Store is one way to do it (I think the best)\nThere is also the \"Redux\" pattern - more later, NGRX Store is redux pattern, used a lot \"here\", and is still great, but Signal Store can do it with the \"events' thing.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Selling the consistency of how you represent state in a service.\nThis is a thing that *should* be done consistently across your application. \nSignal Store is one way to do it (I think the best)\nThere is also the \"Redux\" pattern - more later, NGRX Store is redux pattern, used a lot \"here\", and is still great, but Signal Store can do it with the \"events' thing.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
