      "text": "- to do an \"outbox\"\n\n- when you send the item to the server, use an http interceptor\n    to add a item to a store that tracks that request.\n\n- when the response comes back, compare it with the stored version and\n    - if it is a success, remove it.\n    - if it is a failure, move it to a \"dead-letter\" or error store \n      do display the error.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- to do an \"outbox\"\n\n- when you send the item to the server, use an http interceptor\n    to add a item to a store that tracks that request.\n\n- when the response comes back, compare it with the stored version and\n    - if it is a success, remove it.\n    - if it is a failure, move it to a \"dead-letter\" or error store \n      do display the error.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
